+ * OPL2 = 9 voices, single register bank at 0x388/0x389 ONLY -- NO secondary
+ * bank (0x38A/0x38B), NO OPL3-enable (0x105), NO 4-op (0x104). The existing
+ * SDL_DOSOpl3WriteRegister already routes reg<0x100 to the primary bank, and
+ * voices 0-8 (s_opl3_voice_offsets[0..8]) are all primary-bank, so
+ * SDL_DOSOpl3VoiceWritePatch/NoteOn/NoteOff for voice_id 0-8 work UNCHANGED on
+ * a real OPL2 (the patch struct + note formula are bank-agnostic). Only chip
+ * init/shutdown + detect differ from the OPL3 path. Music only -- a pure OPL2
+ * card has no DAC/DMA so Cave Story PCM SFX cannot play (by hardware).
+ * ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
